    "excerpt": "As modern aesthetics reach far beyond the stratosphere, futuristic styling is taking over. Think prismatic, holographic home details, cosmic eye pigments reminiscent of raw moon dust, and sculptural silhouettes pulled straight from a sci-fi cinema. This avant-garde wave has officially arrived—bringing an impeccably curated, timeless edge to modern beauty.",
    "coverImage": "https://kaed8r5jy7b093je.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/blogs/beyond-reality-the-art-of-icy-frosted-elegance-and-intergalactic-beauty-1791198442283-955z8VlunMeCPAiB7cpCDCqNLv9pnS.jpg",
