    "category": "makeup",
    "excerpt": "Toss out the ruler and embrace artistic freedom. Discover why mismatched manicures, dual-toned lips, and avant-garde makeup trends are replacing rigid symmetry.",
    "coverImage": "https://kaed8r5jy7b093je.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/blogs/anti-perfection-beauty-why-mismatched-manicures-and-dual-toned-lips-are-taking-over-1791035591713-fcHpjOaBjU3ZW1dGQD7m34NvbkUKvQ.jpg",
