    "content": "<div class=\"blog-reader-content mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl text-left text-foreground/90\"><div><h2>The Art of the Base</h2><p>Building a flawless base is less about the coverage and more about how you prepare the canvas underneath. Start with a freshly cleansed face, apply a hydrating serum, and lock it in with a rich moisturizer.</p><p>Once your skin is prepped, it's time for foundation. Our absolute favorite for an undetectable, skin-like finish is the Canvas Foundation.</p><p></p></div><div><p></p><p>Apply it with a damp beauty sponge or a dense brush for maximum control. Remember, you want your skin to look like skin—just elevated.</p></div></div>",
